, and see who comes out on top. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, Action-Packed Tracks</strong>: Featuring both small and large asphalt and concrete ovals where every move counts. Close quarters racing means there\u2019s no room for mistakes\u2014bump, jostle, and push your way to the front.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saturday Night Thunder:</strong> A progression mode where you compete to win all Signature Events and compete in head-to-head duels to become the Track Champion at each track while earning fans along the way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online  Leaderboards</strong>: Challenge yourself to become the world ranking driver! Compete for the fastest lap on each track and climb the global leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements</strong>: Unlock a variety of Steam achievements as you conquer podiums, set new lap records, and become the track champion. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Optimization:</strong> Resolution and graphics options are configured to allow a smooth gameplay experience on the Steam Deck. <i>Use of trackpads is required to navigate game menus.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Settings &amp; AI Optimization:</strong> Tailor the experience to your abilities with 3 difficulty levels and 3 tire grip settings. Race against the AI opponents who will alter their racing lines, draft, and lift for the player accordingly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["JBSIMWORKS"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283590/header.jpg?t=1759351586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requ